            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Full Controller Support!</h1><p>Play on your controller from Xbox 360, Xbox One, Steam, Playstation 3, Playstation 4, and many more!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Destroy your enemies however you want to destroy your enemies. If you want to button mash through them, that will work for the weaker ones. If you want to block and counter their attacks, you can. If you want to dodge or roll away from their attacks, you can. If you want to crush your enemy to death with a giant rock, then you just need to find a giant rock.",
            "about_the_game": "Destroy your enemies however you want to destroy your enemies. If you want to button mash through them, that will work for the weaker ones. If you want to block and counter their attacks, you can. If you want to dodge or roll away from their attacks, you can. If you want to crush your enemy to death with a giant rock, then you just need to find a giant rock.",
            "short_description": "A wholesome family appropriate story of bestiality, human sacrifice, and graphic violence! Play as the Minotaur as you hack and slash your way out of the labyrinth, and experience freedom.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Chinês simplificado, Alemão, Russo<br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
